# Address of the phrase service (the Cloudflare Worker in worker/). Not a secret: it is public in the built site.
# Copy to .env.production (used by `pnpm build`) or .env.local (used by `pnpm dev`) and fill in your Worker URL.
# Leave it empty to run without suggestions being checked; the Suggest dialog then offers copy-only.
VITE_COMMUNITY_API=https://word-bridge-phrases.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev
